WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-First of all, happy new year.
-And to you.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.536 line:92%
-You have a daughter now.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you enjoy the holidays
with her?

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.341 line:92%
-I did, yeah. I mean, yeah.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good.
-Yeah.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.010 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you think she would say
the same thing?

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:13.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She might have
a different story.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:16.182 size:75% position:38%
-But I was wondering
if being a parent --

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:18.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I felt this
a fair amount.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.719 line:92%
You become more empathetic.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
You become a little kinder
when you have a child.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.890 line:92%
Don't take this the wrong way.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've always been cruel
to my dog Frisbee.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.331
-Do you feel any different about
her now that you're a parent?

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:32.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Okay.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.236 size:75% position:38%
-But I will also say
you now have kids.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:36.669 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:39.472 line:92%
-And I'm like, why keep Frisbee?

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.307 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I will say this.
-Yeah.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You sent your holiday card
to me.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:46.379 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yep.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.182
-And you did actually take into
account my Frisbee hatred.

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:50.350 line:92%
And I really appreciate it.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I should give credit
to my wife here.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.989
She wrote -- she hand-wrote
on the back of the envelope,

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:59.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Caution --
Frisbee photo contained."

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.530
And I picked it up and looked at
my wife and I was like, "Uh-oh.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
if I want to look at this."

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.501
And then, sure enough, I opened
it up and what do I see?

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:09.569 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-There you go. Come on!

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:13.339 line:92%
-Frisbee with the Star of David?

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:17.343
-Haven't we been through enough,
Seth?

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:22.382 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:25.618 line:92%
Frickin' little skeleton rat!

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She is not a skeleton rat.
-Oh, man!

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.723 line:92%
-Look at her. She's gorgeous.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.759 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-The kids are beautiful.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.828 line:92%
Again, I'm a human lover.

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:36.496 line:92%
And I like almost every dog.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.697 line:92%
-Was it this year or last year

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:42.102
where you sent it back to us
with Frisbee out of the photo?

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:44.537 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Because you did that.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have so much
less spare time now.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.307 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have to come here
to talk about it.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:49.976 size:78% position:39%
-Hey, congratulations
on the Golden Globes.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:51.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-You did a fantastic job.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:56.583 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a couple of things
we've both hosted.

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:01.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is one of them.
-Yeah.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is a -- People say this
all of the time.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:04.724 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It is a tough room.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not because people don't have
a good sense of humor.

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:10.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is one of the loudest rooms
you could ever play.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Deafeningly loud.
-Yeah.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.801
-People are not paying attention
to what you're doing on stage.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.171
They're just kind of talking
to each other and being famous.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:18.972 line:92%
-Yeah. Well, that's the thing.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.674
You want to tell everybody to
shut up, but then you look,

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.910 size:84% position:42%
and they're all so much
more famous than you.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.477 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, exactly.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:29.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't be like, "Hey,
Nicholson! I'm doing my joke!"

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:30.617 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.185 line:92%
He'll say, "Yeah, I'll eat you."

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:35.221
-We had a -- You had a --
Obviously, the same way I did --

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of friends
pitched in jokes.

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:38.024 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:39.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And some writers
from this show, actually,

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
went out and were backstage
with you.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:42.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Absolutely, I did.

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.064
I worked with three of your
writers, Amber, Jenny and Ally.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and there they are,
right over there.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:51.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Andy!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:52.438 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.173 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hey, Andy.

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.475 line:92%
Rhinoceros teeth, remember?

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:56.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I love it!
-Sorry. What's that?

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:01.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no, it's just a thing
that we do now

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
since we worked together
on the Globes.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, it was, like,
an inside joke then.

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:06.252 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Did you guys have fun?

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, so much fun.
-Oh, it was great.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.023
-Yeah, I mean, it was different,
you know?

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What do you mean?
Like, different than this?

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.128 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-No, just -- better.

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.563 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Andy just gets it.

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.831 line:92%
-You know what we mean, Steve.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth.
-Oh, my God! Seth! Oh.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:22.936 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:23.903 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, Seth.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.004 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I mean, you know.

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was the Globes,
and it's a big deal.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.709 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You wouldn't understand.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, yeah, I hosted it
last year.

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:33.246 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:34.480 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I thought she did.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.848 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah, you were great!

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:36.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you!
-Yeah.

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Anyway, Andy, we'll see you
at the after party.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait, this show
has an after party?

00:03:41.621 --> 00:03:42.689 line:92%
-Oh, Seth, you wouldn't like it.

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:45.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just a bunch of people
you know and work with.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:45.858 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Shh!

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:48.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I, uh, I think
it's cancelled.

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
It's cancelled.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:54.601
-I'll see you
at the "cancelled" after party.

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:58.771
-All right. Give it up for
these awful, awful women!

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.606 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:02.575 line:92%
Just kidding. Love you guys!

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:04.978 line:92%
Bye, my three new best friends!

